Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the round that still ends on paper. A clipboard, a\Nshift, and numbers retyped back at the office, hours after the\Nreading was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.63,0:00:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Plant, pipeline, refinery. Alarm floods, relief valves past\Ntheir test date, and inspection findings that nobody can find at\Ntwo in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,IntegrityWatch Field runs on the tablet. No server, no cloud,\Nand no signal required before an operator can make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.13,0:00:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Import the round as a CSV. Forty eight readings, mapped,\Nvalidated and committed on the device. Zero rows skipped, and\Nthe evidence stays with the shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.22,0:01:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Register the equipment against ISO 14224, set the risk band, and\Nthe inspection interval follows. Overdue relief valves surface\Non their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then generate the dossier on the same tablet, ready to print,\Nsign and hand over without waiting for the network to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Field data, field decisions, no signal required.
